  "articleBody": "Converting a garage into an ADU can create a permitted independent living space, but the project must be evaluated as a residential conversion rather than a cosmetic remodel. Before hiring, confirm the garage’s permit history, structural condition, utility capacity, layout, local jurisdiction, and intended use so the design, permit package, construction scope, and quote reflect the real work required.",
